description:
Design a state machine that operates as a custom counter, cycling through specific 8-bit patterns on each rising edge of the clock signal. The counter can be reset to the initial state (8'b10000001) when the clear input is activated. It sequentially transitions through the states 8'b10000001, 8'b01000010, 8'b00100100, and 8'b00011000, before returning to the start state. The current state of the counter is continually output on cct_output.
